    "text": "keweenawreport.com\nwebsite\nHoughton\nHoughton Police respond to bicycle hit and run incident near Townsend Drive\nBy Thomas Fournier,\n16 hours agoHoughton Police seek information regarding a hit an run accident that occured yesterday in the city. At 1:50 pm the houghton city police department was dispatched to the scene of a personal injury accident. Upon arrival officers attended to a 21 year old minnesota man who was struck by a moving vehicle while riding a bicycle on the sidewalk. The man was transported to uphs portage for treatment.",
